Z||000001||batboy||04-12-2000||09:38 PM||||Those two smilies that you mentioned were custom made by Forum members. The rest of them can be found if you click on the "Smilies Legend" link located to the left of the "post a topic" text box.||||reg||1
Z||000002||olympic||04-13-2000||02:19 PM||||To use the custom smilies click on the "edit post" icon above the post with the smilie in it.   In there you will see the html code for the smilie.   Just highlight the code and right click on it and select "copy".  Then just "paste" the code somewhere where you can retrieve it easily, like "my documents" or your email "drafts" folder.   Have fun.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://24.8.34.90/faces/laugh2.gif">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/bigass_cow/smileysex5.gif">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://24.8.34.90/faces/lickout.gif">  <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://members.home.net/1nicez/images/emoticons/smokin.gif">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://thedam.com/cwm/smile/cwm/eek2.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by olympic (edited 04-13-2000).]||||reg||1
